    "detailed_description": "<strong>Tattos and Tulips</strong> is a feel-good BL visual novel featuring a budding romance between a grumpy florist named Chrys, and a friendly tattoo artist named Shay!<br><br><strong>Story:</strong><br>Chrys is jaded and unlucky in love. He just wants to focus on being 20\u2014hanging out with friends, working in customer service, and trying not to get his heart broken for the millionth time.<br><br>Everything changes for him the day a friendly tattoo artist named Shay comes into his shop to sketch the tulips.<br><br>A kinetic visual novel (no choices). That doesn't mean there aren't twists and turns however!<br><br><strong>Features:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>60K words (18 Chapters + Epilogue)<br></li><li>8 Gorgeous CGs!<br></li><li>Original artwork throughout made by real people!<br></li><li>Original soundtrack!<br></li><li>Partial voice acting!</li></ul><br><strong>Characters:</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427460/extras/1f0ccac3f1512dec108c3846ebf41840.avif?t=1744829536\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427460/extras/d86ea55013a418ec8da6564e06c92b5a.avif?t=1744829536\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427460/extras/fecf42bc4543a745e6ceca7c03593cd9.avif?t=1744829536\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427460/extras/2419dd3327e177d2a5e4ca445205b85c.avif?t=1744829536\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427460/extras/497e9236de33f99daee856cccba33512.avif?t=1744829536\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class